[18.970505, "o", "6. **Save Command**: Save the exact jq command you execute to a file named '\"'\"'/app/cmd.sh'\"'\"'. This file should contain the complete jq command used to generate the output, including all options and arguments.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 7. **Save Arguments**: Save all jq arguments(excluding input/output files) to a YAML file named '\"'\"'/app/jq_args.yaml'\"'\"'. This file should contain exactly two keys:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - '\"'\"'filter'\"'\"': A string containing the jq filter expression\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
